      "title": "IR canonical JSON Mapping compatibility",
      "type": "fixed",
      "component": "ir-artifacts",
      "owner": "team-polisyos",
      "summary": "The exported get_json_artifact reader now accepts the JSON-mode Mapping form of a supported canonical profile while preserving strict profile checks.",
