        "tests/unit/core/artifacts/test_ir_adapter.py"
      ],
      "compatibility": "For JSON-mode Mapping manifests, only separators lists containing exactly two strings are normalized before strict profile validation; missing or unsupported profiles still fail before payload bytes are read. Historical profile-less artifact support has not been established.",
